          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Shrinking fiscal space forces governments to scale back R&amp;D grants, public procurement and co‑investment programs that directly seed and accelerate AI projects, reducing the pace of AI investment." />
